 IFAC SYSID 2027 - Joint journal/conference submission (cutoff time unanno
 unced)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: IFAC Symposium on System Identification\nWebs
 ite: https://conferences.ifac-control.org/sysid2027/\nSource URL: https:/
 /conferences.ifac-control.org/sysid2027/participate/\nLocation: Lyon\, Fr
 ance\nTopics: System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics\, Control & Ro
 botics\, Time Series & Sequential Data\, Machine Learning\nSize: M\nSubmi
 ssion type: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-1
 0-06\nNotes: Triennial TC 1.1 symposium. Regular papers\, joint journal p
 apers\, and dissemination/discussion routes have distinct requirements\; 
 consult the call. Published deadline days are confirmed but cutoff hours 
 use estimated end-of-day AoE. Size is an editorial category.\nScope: Syst
 em identification and data-driven modeling for dynamical systems and cont
 rol. Characteristic themes include nonlinear identification\, model reduc
 tion\, identification software and benchmarks\, learning across systems\,
  and dynamic networks. Application tracks remain grounded in identifying 
