 undations\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-based / non-archival extended 
 abstracts\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: F
 ifth annual edition\, in person at Northeastern University. Extended Aug 
 5/7 deadlines replace the struck-through July 29/Aug 1 dates. Proceedings
  papers and non-archival extended abstracts share the registration and fi
 nal submission cutoffs\, represented as one route. The TMLR presentation 
 track requires an already published paper\, so it is not a new-paper oppo
 rtunity. LoG is distinct from LOD/AIS. Size M is an editorial estimate.\n
